  "worked_solution": "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $u,v$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
